It is not currently possible to deploy Shiny Server on Windows. The best you could do is to run a separate (or virtual) Linux server to host Shiny Server, and proxy to it using IIS.
http://serverfault.com/questions/47537/can-iis-be-configure-to-forward-request-to-another-web-server

